Third-party data and media
==========================

OTB-2015 Jogging
- Source: Visual Tracker Benchmark (OTB100)
- Authors: Yi Wu, Jongwoo Lim, Ming-Hsuan Yang
- Citation: "Object Tracking Benchmark", IEEE TPAMI, 2015
- The OTB frames and annotations are the work of their original authors and
  are subject to the OTB benchmark's research-use terms. They are not covered
  by the MIT license. The video is not committed; download_otb_jogging.py
  fetches the archived OTB sequence. The derived ground-truth CSV files and
  result figures in this repository are included for reproducibility with
  attribution.

OpenCV vtest.avi
- Source: OpenCV sample data.
- vtest.avi is not committed; `python driftguard.py --download` fetches the
  OpenCV sample.

Report and screenshots
- The technical report and report figures contain frames from the datasets
  above. They are included for documentation and research reproducibility.
